<div id="A4.SS2.2" class="ltx_proof">
<h6 class="ltx_title ltx_runin ltx_font_italic ltx_title_proof">Proof.</h6>
<div id="A4.SS2.p2" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A4.SS2.p2.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A4.SS2.p2.1.1" class="ltx_text">To simplify notations in this proof, unless otherwise specified, <math id="A4.SS2.p2.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="{\color[rgb]{0,0,0}\theta}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">θ</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">{\color[rgb]{0,0,0}\theta}</annotation></semantics></math> indicates a random variable distributed according to <math id="A4.SS2.p2.m2" class="ltx_math_unparsed" alttext="\widehat{\prob}(\cdot\nonscript\&gt;|\nonscript\&gt;\mathopen{}{\color[rgb]{0,0,0}X})" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mover accent="true"><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">ℙ</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0.220em">⋅</mo><mo fence="false" rspace="0.387em" stretchy="false">|</mo><mrow><mphantom></mphantom><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">X</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\widehat{\prob}(\cdot\nonscript\&gt;|\nonscript\&gt;\mathopen{}{\color[rgb]{0,0,0}X})</annotation></semantics></math>.
We start from <a href="#A4.Thmlemma2" title="Lemma D.2. ‣ D.1 Preliminary Lemmas ‣ Appendix D Task Selection ‣ How Does the Pretraining Distribution Shape In-Context Learning?Task Selection, Generalization, and Robustness" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">Lemma</span> <span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">D.2</span></a> with <math id="A4.SS2.p2.m3" class="ltx_Math" alttext="{\color[rgb]{0,0,0}L}({\color[rgb]{0,0,0}X},{\color[rgb]{0,0,0}\theta})={\color[rgb]{0,0,0}\rho}\log\frac{d\prob_{\!#1}(\cdot\nonscript\&gt;|\nonscript\&gt;\mathopen{}{\color[rgb]{0,0,0}\theta})}{d\prob_{\!#1}(\cdot)}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">L</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">X</mi><mo>,</mo><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">θ</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>=</mo><mrow><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">ρ</mi><mo lspace="0.167em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mi>log</mi><mo lspace="0.167em">⁡</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">ℙ</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mrow><mi>#</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0.220em">⋅</mo><mo fence="false" rspace="0.387em" stretchy="false">|</mo><mphantom></mphantom><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">θ</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mrow><mi>d</mi><mo lspace="0.167em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">ℙ</mi><mrow><mi>#</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">⋅</mo><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mfrac></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">{\color[rgb]{0,0,0}L}({\color[rgb]{0,0,0}X},{\color[rgb]{0,0,0}\theta})={\color[rgb]{0,0,0}\rho}\log\frac{d\prob_{\!#1}(\cdot\nonscript\&gt;|\nonscript\&gt;\mathopen{}{\color[rgb]{0,0,0}\theta})}{d\prob_{\!#1}(\cdot)}</annotation></semantics></math> and rearrange to obtain:</span></p>
<table id="A4.EGx6" class="ltx_equationgroup ltx_eqn_align ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody id="A4.E13"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_right ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A4.E13.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle\ex_{#1}\left[-\log\ex_{#1}\left[\left(\frac{d\prob_{\!#1}(\cdot\nonscript\&gt;|\nonscript\&gt;\mathopen{}{\color[rgb]{0,0,0}\theta})}{d\prob_{\!#1}(\cdot)}\right)^{{\color[rgb]{0,0,0}\rho}}\right]\right]\leq" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><msub><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">𝔼</mi><mrow><mi>#</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo>[</mo><mrow><mo rspace="0.167em">−</mo><mrow><mi>log</mi><mo lspace="0.167em">⁡</mo><mrow><msub><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">𝔼</mi><mrow><mi>#</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo>[</mo><msup><mrow><mo>(</mo><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">ℙ</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mrow><mi>#</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0.220em">⋅</mo><mo fence="false" rspace="0.387em" stretchy="false">|</mo><mphantom></mphantom><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">θ</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mrow><mi>d</mi><mo lspace="0.167em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">ℙ</mi><mrow><mi>#</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">⋅</mo><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mfrac></mstyle><mo>)</mo></mrow><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">ρ</mi></msup><mo>]</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo>]</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>≤</mo><mphantom></mphantom></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle\ex_{#1}\left[-\log\ex_{#1}\left[\left(\frac{d\prob_{\!#1}(\cdot\nonscript\&gt;|\nonscript\&gt;\mathopen{}{\color[rgb]{0,0,0}\theta})}{d\prob_{\!#1}(\cdot)}\right)^{{\color[rgb]{0,0,0}\rho}}\right]\right]\leq</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A4.E13.m2" class="ltx_math_unparsed" alttext="\displaystyle\ex_{#1}\left[{\color[rgb]{0,0,0}\rho}\log\frac{d\prob_{\!#1}(\cdot)}{d\prob_{\!#1}(\cdot\nonscript\&gt;|\nonscript\&gt;\mathopen{}{\color[rgb]{0,0,0}\theta})}\right]+\ex_{#1}\left[{\mathrm{KL}}\!(\prob_{\!#1}(\cdot\nonscript\&gt;|\nonscript\&gt;\mathopen{}{\color[rgb]{0,0,0}X})\,\|\,{\color[rgb]{0,0,0}\pi})\right]\,." display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">𝔼</mi><mrow><mi>#</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mrow><mo>[</mo><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">ρ</mi><mi>log</mi><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><mrow><mi>d</mi><mo lspace="0.167em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">ℙ</mi><mrow><mi>#</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">⋅</mo><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">ℙ</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mrow><mi>#</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0.220em">⋅</mo><mo fence="false" rspace="0.387em" stretchy="false">|</mo><mphantom></mphantom><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">θ</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mfrac></mstyle><mo>]</mo></mrow><mo>+</mo><msub><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">𝔼</mi><mrow><mi>#</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mrow><mo>[</mo><mpadded style="width:1.431em;" width="1.431em"><mi>KL</mi></mpadded><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">ℙ</mi><mrow><mi>#</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0.220em">⋅</mo><mo fence="false" rspace="0.387em" stretchy="false">|</mo><mrow><mphantom></mphantom><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">X</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo lspace="0.170em" rspace="0.337em">∥</mo><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">π</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo>]</mo></mrow><mo lspace="0.170em">.</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle\ex_{#1}\left[{\color[rgb]{0,0,0}\rho}\log\frac{d\prob_{\!#1}(\cdot)}{d\prob_{\!#1}(\cdot\nonscript\&gt;|\nonscript\&gt;\mathopen{}{\color[rgb]{0,0,0}\theta})}\right]+\ex_{#1}\left[{\mathrm{KL}}\!(\prob_{\!#1}(\cdot\nonscript\&gt;|\nonscript\&gt;\mathopen{}{\color[rgb]{0,0,0}X})\,\|\,{\color[rgb]{0,0,0}\pi})\right]\,.</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td>
<td rowspan="1" class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_eqno ltx_align_middle ltx_align_right"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_equation ltx_align_right">(D.13)</span></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
<p id="A4.SS2.p2.2" class="ltx_p"><span id="A4.SS2.p2.2.1" class="ltx_text">The  <span title="" class="ltx_glossaryref ltx_missing">LHS</span> (<abbr title="" class="ltx_glossaryref ltx_missing">LHS</abbr>) is the quantity we want to bound. We now only need to bound the <abbr title="" class="ltx_glossaryref ltx_missing">RHS</abbr>.
Making <math id="A4.SS2.p2.m4" class="ltx_Math" alttext="{\color[rgb]{0,0,0}{\color[rgb]{0,0,0}\theta}_{0}}\in{\color[rgb]{0,0,0}\Theta}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">θ</mi><mn style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">0</mn></msub><mo>∈</mo><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000" mathvariant="normal">Θ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">{\color[rgb]{0,0,0}{\color[rgb]{0,0,0}\theta}_{0}}\in{\color[rgb]{0,0,0}\Theta}</annotation></semantics></math> appear in the bound, we have</span></p>
<table id="A4.EGx7" class="ltx_equationgroup ltx_eqn_align ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody id="A4.E14"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_eqn_cell"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A4.E14.m1" class="ltx_math_unparsed" alttext="\displaystyle\ex_{#1}\left[{\color[rgb]{0,0,0}\rho}\log\frac{d\prob_{\!#1}(\cdot)}{d\prob_{\!#1}(\cdot\nonscript\&gt;|\nonscript\&gt;\mathopen{}{\color[rgb]{0,0,0}\theta})}\right]+\ex_{#1}\left[{\mathrm{KL}}\!(\prob_{\!#1}(\cdot\nonscript\&gt;|\nonscript\&gt;\mathopen{}{\color[rgb]{0,0,0}X})\,\|\,{\color[rgb]{0,0,0}\pi})\right]" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">𝔼</mi><mrow><mi>#</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mrow><mo>[</mo><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">ρ</mi><mi>log</mi><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><mrow><mi>d</mi><mo lspace="0.167em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">ℙ</mi><mrow><mi>#</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">⋅</mo><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">ℙ</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mrow><mi>#</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0.220em">⋅</mo><mo fence="false" rspace="0.387em" stretchy="false">|</mo><mphantom></mphantom><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">θ</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mfrac></mstyle><mo>]</mo></mrow><mo>+</mo><msub><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">𝔼</mi><mrow><mi>#</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mrow><mo>[</mo><mpadded style="width:1.431em;" width="1.431em"><mi>KL</mi></mpadded><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">ℙ</mi><mrow><mi>#</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0.220em">⋅</mo><mo fence="false" rspace="0.387em" stretchy="false">|</mo><mrow><mphantom></mphantom><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">X</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo lspace="0.170em" rspace="0.337em">∥</mo><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">π</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo>]</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle\ex_{#1}\left[{\color[rgb]{0,0,0}\rho}\log\frac{d\prob_{\!#1}(\cdot)}{d\prob_{\!#1}(\cdot\nonscript\&gt;|\nonscript\&gt;\mathopen{}{\color[rgb]{0,0,0}\theta})}\right]+\ex_{#1}\left[{\mathrm{KL}}\!(\prob_{\!#1}(\cdot\nonscript\&gt;|\nonscript\&gt;\mathopen{}{\color[rgb]{0,0,0}X})\,\|\,{\color[rgb]{0,0,0}\pi})\right]</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td>
<td rowspan="1" class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_eqno ltx_align_middle ltx_align_right"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_equation ltx_align_right">(D.14)</span></td></tr></tbody>
<tbody id="A4.E15"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_eqn_cell"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A4.E15.m1" class="ltx_math_unparsed" alttext="\displaystyle={\color[rgb]{0,0,0}\rho}\ex_{#1}\left[\log\frac{d\prob_{\!#1}(\cdot)}{d\prob_{\!#1}(\cdot\nonscript\&gt;|\nonscript\&gt;\mathopen{}{\color[rgb]{0,0,0}{\color[rgb]{0,0,0}\theta}_{0}})}\right]+\ex_{#1}\left[{\color[rgb]{0,0,0}\rho}\log\frac{d\prob_{\!#1}(\cdot\nonscript\&gt;|\nonscript\&gt;\mathopen{}{\color[rgb]{0,0,0}{\color[rgb]{0,0,0}\theta}_{0}})}{d\prob_{\!#1}(\cdot\nonscript\&gt;|\nonscript\&gt;\mathopen{}{\color[rgb]{0,0,0}\theta})}\right]+\ex_{#1}\left[{\mathrm{KL}}\!(\prob_{\!#1}(\cdot\nonscript\&gt;|\nonscript\&gt;\mathopen{}{\color[rgb]{0,0,0}X})\,\|\,{\color[rgb]{0,0,0}\pi})\right]" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mo>=</mo><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">ρ</mi><msub><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">𝔼</mi><mrow><mi>#</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mrow><mo>[</mo><mi>log</mi><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><mrow><mi>d</mi><mo lspace="0.167em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">ℙ</mi><mrow><mi>#</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">⋅</mo><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">ℙ</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mrow><mi>#</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0.220em">⋅</mo><mo fence="false" rspace="0.387em" stretchy="false">|</mo><mphantom></mphantom><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">θ</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mn style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">0</mn></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mfrac></mstyle><mo>]</mo></mrow><mo>+</mo><msub><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">𝔼</mi><mrow><mi>#</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mrow><mo>[</mo><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">ρ</mi><mi>log</mi><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">ℙ</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mrow><mi>#</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0.220em">⋅</mo><mo fence="false" rspace="0.387em" stretchy="false">|</mo><mphantom></mphantom><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">θ</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mn style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">0</mn></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">ℙ</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mrow><mi>#</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0.220em">⋅</mo><mo fence="false" rspace="0.387em" stretchy="false">|</mo><mphantom></mphantom><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">θ</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mfrac></mstyle><mo>]</mo></mrow><mo>+</mo><msub><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">𝔼</mi><mrow><mi>#</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mrow><mo>[</mo><mpadded style="width:1.431em;" width="1.431em"><mi>KL</mi></mpadded><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">ℙ</mi><mrow><mi>#</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0.220em">⋅</mo><mo fence="false" rspace="0.387em" stretchy="false">|</mo><mrow><mphantom></mphantom><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">X</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo lspace="0.170em" rspace="0.337em">∥</mo><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">π</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo>]</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle={\color[rgb]{0,0,0}\rho}\ex_{#1}\left[\log\frac{d\prob_{\!#1}(\cdot)}{d\prob_{\!#1}(\cdot\nonscript\&gt;|\nonscript\&gt;\mathopen{}{\color[rgb]{0,0,0}{\color[rgb]{0,0,0}\theta}_{0}})}\right]+\ex_{#1}\left[{\color[rgb]{0,0,0}\rho}\log\frac{d\prob_{\!#1}(\cdot\nonscript\&gt;|\nonscript\&gt;\mathopen{}{\color[rgb]{0,0,0}{\color[rgb]{0,0,0}\theta}_{0}})}{d\prob_{\!#1}(\cdot\nonscript\&gt;|\nonscript\&gt;\mathopen{}{\color[rgb]{0,0,0}\theta})}\right]+\ex_{#1}\left[{\mathrm{KL}}\!(\prob_{\!#1}(\cdot\nonscript\&gt;|\nonscript\&gt;\mathopen{}{\color[rgb]{0,0,0}X})\,\|\,{\color[rgb]{0,0,0}\pi})\right]</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td>
<td rowspan="1" class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_eqno ltx_align_middle ltx_align_right"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_equation ltx_align_right">(D.15)</span></td></tr></tbody>
<tbody id="A4.E16"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_eqn_cell"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A4.E16.m1" class="ltx_math_unparsed" alttext="\displaystyle={\color[rgb]{0,0,0}\rho}{\mathrm{KL}}\!\left(\prob_{\!#1}(\cdot)\,\|\,\prob_{\!#1}\left(\cdot\nonscript\&gt;\middle|\nonscript\&gt;\mathopen{}{\color[rgb]{0,0,0}{\color[rgb]{0,0,0}\theta}_{0}}\right)\right)" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mo>=</mo><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">ρ</mi><mpadded style="width:1.431em;" width="1.431em"><mi>KL</mi></mpadded><mrow><mo>(</mo><msub><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">ℙ</mi><mrow><mi>#</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">⋅</mo><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo lspace="0.170em" rspace="0.337em">∥</mo><msub><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">ℙ</mi><mrow><mi>#</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mrow><mo>(</mo><mo lspace="0em">⋅</mo><mo rspace="0.220em" stretchy="true">|</mo><mrow><mphantom></mphantom><msub><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">θ</mi><mn style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">0</mn></msub><mo>)</mo></mrow><mo>)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle={\color[rgb]{0,0,0}\rho}{\mathrm{KL}}\!\left(\prob_{\!#1}(\cdot)\,\|\,\prob_{\!#1}\left(\cdot\nonscript\&gt;\middle|\nonscript\&gt;\mathopen{}{\color[rgb]{0,0,0}{\color[rgb]{0,0,0}\theta}_{0}}\right)\right)</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td>
<td rowspan="1" class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_eqno ltx_align_middle ltx_align_right"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_equation ltx_align_right">(D.16)</span></td></tr></tbody>
<tbody id="A4.E17"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_eqn_cell"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A4.E17.m1" class="ltx_math_unparsed" alttext="\displaystyle\quad+\ex_{#1}\left[{\color[rgb]{0,0,0}\rho}\log\frac{d\prob_{\!#1}(\cdot)}{d\prob_{\!#1}(\cdot\nonscript\&gt;|\nonscript\&gt;\mathopen{}{\color[rgb]{0,0,0}\theta})}\right]+\ex_{#1}\left[{\mathrm{KL}}\!(\prob_{\!#1}(\cdot\nonscript\&gt;|\nonscript\&gt;\mathopen{}{\color[rgb]{0,0,0}X})\,\|\,{\color[rgb]{0,0,0}\pi})\right]\,." display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mo>+</mo><msub><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">𝔼</mi><mrow><mi>#</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mrow><mo>[</mo><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">ρ</mi><mi>log</mi><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><mrow><mi>d</mi><mo lspace="0.167em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">ℙ</mi><mrow><mi>#</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">⋅</mo><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">ℙ</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mrow><mi>#</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0.220em">⋅</mo><mo fence="false" rspace="0.387em" stretchy="false">|</mo><mphantom></mphantom><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">θ</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mfrac></mstyle><mo>]</mo></mrow><mo>+</mo><msub><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">𝔼</mi><mrow><mi>#</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mrow><mo>[</mo><mpadded style="width:1.431em;" width="1.431em"><mi>KL</mi></mpadded><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">ℙ</mi><mrow><mi>#</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0.220em">⋅</mo><mo fence="false" rspace="0.387em" stretchy="false">|</mo><mrow><mphantom></mphantom><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">X</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo lspace="0.170em" rspace="0.337em">∥</mo><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">π</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo>]</mo></mrow><mo lspace="0.170em">.</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle\quad+\ex_{#1}\left[{\color[rgb]{0,0,0}\rho}\log\frac{d\prob_{\!#1}(\cdot)}{d\prob_{\!#1}(\cdot\nonscript\&gt;|\nonscript\&gt;\mathopen{}{\color[rgb]{0,0,0}\theta})}\right]+\ex_{#1}\left[{\mathrm{KL}}\!(\prob_{\!#1}(\cdot\nonscript\&gt;|\nonscript\&gt;\mathopen{}{\color[rgb]{0,0,0}X})\,\|\,{\color[rgb]{0,0,0}\pi})\right]\,.</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td>
<td rowspan="1" class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_eqno ltx_align_middle ltx_align_right"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_equation ltx_align_right">(D.17)</span></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
<p id="A4.SS2.p2.3" class="ltx_p"><span id="A4.SS2.p2.3.1" class="ltx_text">Introducing <math id="A4.SS2.p2.m5" class="ltx_Math" alttext="{\color[rgb]{0,0,0}\alpha}&gt;1" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">α</mi><mo>&gt;</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">{\color[rgb]{0,0,0}\alpha}&gt;1</annotation></semantics></math> and defining <math id="A4.SS2.p2.m6" class="ltx_Math" alttext="{\color[rgb]{0,0,0}\mu}=\frac{{\color[rgb]{0,0,0}\alpha}-1}{{\color[rgb]{0,0,0}\alpha}-{\color[rgb]{0,0,0}\rho}}&lt;1" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">μ</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">α</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">α</mi><mo>−</mo><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">ρ</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>&lt;</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">{\color[rgb]{0,0,0}\mu}=\frac{{\color[rgb]{0,0,0}\alpha}-1}{{\color[rgb]{0,0,0}\alpha}-{\color[rgb]{0,0,0}\rho}}&lt;1</annotation></semantics></math>, we now bound the last two terms in <a href="#A4.E17" title="In Proof. ‣ D.2 Template Task Selection Bound ‣ Appendix D Task Selection ‣ How Does the Pretraining Distribution Shape In-Context Learning?Task Selection, Generalization, and Robustness" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">Eq.</span> <span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">D.17</span></a> as follows:</span></p>
<table id="A4.EGx8" class="ltx_equationgroup ltx_eqn_align ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody id="A4.E18"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_eqn_cell"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A4.E18.m1" class="ltx_math_unparsed" alttext="\displaystyle\ex_{#1}\left[{\color[rgb]{0,0,0}\rho}\log\frac{d\prob_{\!#1}(\cdot\nonscript\&gt;|\nonscript\&gt;\mathopen{}{\color[rgb]{0,0,0}{\color[rgb]{0,0,0}\theta}_{0}})}{d\prob_{\!#1}(\cdot\nonscript\&gt;|\nonscript\&gt;\mathopen{}{\color[rgb]{0,0,0}\theta})}\right]+\ex_{#1}\left[{\mathrm{KL}}\!(\prob_{\!#1}(\cdot\nonscript\&gt;|\nonscript\&gt;\mathopen{}{\color[rgb]{0,0,0}X})\,\|\,{\color[rgb]{0,0,0}\pi})\right]" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">𝔼</mi><mrow><mi>#</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mrow><mo>[</mo><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">ρ</mi><mi>log</mi><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">ℙ</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mrow><mi>#</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0.220em">⋅</mo><mo fence="false" rspace="0.387em" stretchy="false">|</mo><mphantom></mphantom><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">θ</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mn style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">0</mn></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">ℙ</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mrow><mi>#</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0.220em">⋅</mo><mo fence="false" rspace="0.387em" stretchy="false">|</mo><mphantom></mphantom><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">θ</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mfrac></mstyle><mo>]</mo></mrow><mo>+</mo><msub><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">𝔼</mi><mrow><mi>#</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mrow><mo>[</mo><mpadded style="width:1.431em;" width="1.431em"><mi>KL</mi></mpadded><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">ℙ</mi><mrow><mi>#</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0.220em">⋅</mo><mo fence="false" rspace="0.387em" stretchy="false">|</mo><mrow><mphantom></mphantom><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">X</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo lspace="0.170em" rspace="0.337em">∥</mo><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">π</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo>]</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle\ex_{#1}\left[{\color[rgb]{0,0,0}\rho}\log\frac{d\prob_{\!#1}(\cdot\nonscript\&gt;|\nonscript\&gt;\mathopen{}{\color[rgb]{0,0,0}{\color[rgb]{0,0,0}\theta}_{0}})}{d\prob_{\!#1}(\cdot\nonscript\&gt;|\nonscript\&gt;\mathopen{}{\color[rgb]{0,0,0}\theta})}\right]+\ex_{#1}\left[{\mathrm{KL}}\!(\prob_{\!#1}(\cdot\nonscript\&gt;|\nonscript\&gt;\mathopen{}{\color[rgb]{0,0,0}X})\,\|\,{\color[rgb]{0,0,0}\pi})\right]</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td>
<td rowspan="1" class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_eqno ltx_align_middle ltx_align_right"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_equation ltx_align_right">(D.18)</span></td></tr></tbody>
<tbody id="A4.E19"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_eqn_cell"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A4.E19.m1" class="ltx_math_unparsed" alttext="\displaystyle={\color[rgb]{0,0,0}\alpha}\left(\ex_{#1}\left[\log\frac{d\prob_{\!#1}(\cdot\nonscript\&gt;|\nonscript\&gt;\mathopen{}{\color[rgb]{0,0,0}{\color[rgb]{0,0,0}\theta}_{0}})}{d\prob_{\!#1}(\cdot\nonscript\&gt;|\nonscript\&gt;\mathopen{}{\color[rgb]{0,0,0}\theta})}\right]+\ex_{#1}\left[{\mathrm{KL}}\!(\prob_{\!#1}(\cdot\nonscript\&gt;|\nonscript\&gt;\mathopen{}{\color[rgb]{0,0,0}X})\,\|\,{\color[rgb]{0,0,0}\pi})\right]\right)" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mo>=</mo><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">α</mi><mrow><mo>(</mo><msub><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">𝔼</mi><mrow><mi>#</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mrow><mo>[</mo><mi>log</mi><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">ℙ</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mrow><mi>#</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0.220em">⋅</mo><mo fence="false" rspace="0.387em" stretchy="false">|</mo><mphantom></mphantom><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">θ</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mn style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">0</mn></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">ℙ</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mrow><mi>#</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0.220em">⋅</mo><mo fence="false" rspace="0.387em" stretchy="false">|</mo><mphantom></mphantom><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">θ</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mfrac></mstyle><mo>]</mo></mrow><mo>+</mo><msub><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">𝔼</mi><mrow><mi>#</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mrow><mo>[</mo><mpadded style="width:1.431em;" width="1.431em"><mi>KL</mi></mpadded><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">ℙ</mi><mrow><mi>#</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0.220em">⋅</mo><mo fence="false" rspace="0.387em" stretchy="false">|</mo><mrow><mphantom></mphantom><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">X</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo lspace="0.170em" rspace="0.337em">∥</mo><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">π</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo>]</mo></mrow><mo>)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle={\color[rgb]{0,0,0}\alpha}\left(\ex_{#1}\left[\log\frac{d\prob_{\!#1}(\cdot\nonscript\&gt;|\nonscript\&gt;\mathopen{}{\color[rgb]{0,0,0}{\color[rgb]{0,0,0}\theta}_{0}})}{d\prob_{\!#1}(\cdot\nonscript\&gt;|\nonscript\&gt;\mathopen{}{\color[rgb]{0,0,0}\theta})}\right]+\ex_{#1}\left[{\mathrm{KL}}\!(\prob_{\!#1}(\cdot\nonscript\&gt;|\nonscript\&gt;\mathopen{}{\color[rgb]{0,0,0}X})\,\|\,{\color[rgb]{0,0,0}\pi})\right]\right)</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td>
<td rowspan="1" class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_eqno ltx_align_middle ltx_align_right"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_equation ltx_align_right">(D.19)</span></td></tr></tbody>
<tbody id="A4.E20"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_eqn_cell"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A4.E20.m1" class="ltx_math_unparsed" alttext="\displaystyle\quad-({\color[rgb]{0,0,0}\alpha}-{\color[rgb]{0,0,0}\rho})\left(\ex_{#1}\left[\log\frac{d\prob_{\!#1}(\cdot\nonscript\&gt;|\nonscript\&gt;\mathopen{}{\color[rgb]{0,0,0}{\color[rgb]{0,0,0}\theta}_{0}})}{d\prob_{\!#1}(\cdot\nonscript\&gt;|\nonscript\&gt;\mathopen{}{\color[rgb]{0,0,0}\theta})}\right]+{\color[rgb]{0,0,0}\mu}\ex_{#1}\left[{\mathrm{KL}}\!(\prob_{\!#1}(\cdot\nonscript\&gt;|\nonscript\&gt;\mathopen{}{\color[rgb]{0,0,0}X})\,\|\,{\color[rgb]{0,0,0}\pi})\right]\right)\,." display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mo>−</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">α</mi><mo>−</mo><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">ρ</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mrow><mo>(</mo><msub><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">𝔼</mi><mrow><mi>#</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mrow><mo>[</mo><mi>log</mi><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">ℙ</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mrow><mi>#</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0.220em">⋅</mo><mo fence="false" rspace="0.387em" stretchy="false">|</mo><mphantom></mphantom><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">θ</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mn style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">0</mn></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">ℙ</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mrow><mi>#</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0.220em">⋅</mo><mo fence="false" rspace="0.387em" stretchy="false">|</mo><mphantom></mphantom><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">θ</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mfrac></mstyle><mo>]</mo></mrow><mo>+</mo><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">μ</mi><msub><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">𝔼</mi><mrow><mi>#</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mrow><mo>[</mo><mpadded style="width:1.431em;" width="1.431em"><mi>KL</mi></mpadded><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">ℙ</mi><mrow><mi>#</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0.220em">⋅</mo><mo fence="false" rspace="0.387em" stretchy="false">|</mo><mrow><mphantom></mphantom><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">X</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo lspace="0.170em" rspace="0.337em">∥</mo><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">π</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo>]</mo></mrow><mo>)</mo></mrow><mo lspace="0.170em">.</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle\quad-({\color[rgb]{0,0,0}\alpha}-{\color[rgb]{0,0,0}\rho})\left(\ex_{#1}\left[\log\frac{d\prob_{\!#1}(\cdot\nonscript\&gt;|\nonscript\&gt;\mathopen{}{\color[rgb]{0,0,0}{\color[rgb]{0,0,0}\theta}_{0}})}{d\prob_{\!#1}(\cdot\nonscript\&gt;|\nonscript\&gt;\mathopen{}{\color[rgb]{0,0,0}\theta})}\right]+{\color[rgb]{0,0,0}\mu}\ex_{#1}\left[{\mathrm{KL}}\!(\prob_{\!#1}(\cdot\nonscript\&gt;|\nonscript\&gt;\mathopen{}{\color[rgb]{0,0,0}X})\,\|\,{\color[rgb]{0,0,0}\pi})\right]\right)\,.</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td>
<td rowspan="1" class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_eqno ltx_align_middle ltx_align_right"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_equation ltx_align_right">(D.20)</span></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
<p id="A4.SS2.p2.4" class="ltx_p"><span id="A4.SS2.p2.4.1" class="ltx_text">Let us first focus on the first term.
By the equality case in <a href="#A4.Thmlemma1" title="Lemma D.1 (Donsker-Varadhan lemma, Gibbs variational principle). ‣ D.1 Preliminary Lemmas ‣ Appendix D Task Selection ‣ How Does the Pretraining Distribution Shape In-Context Learning?Task Selection, Generalization, and Robustness" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">Lemma</span> <span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">D.1</span></a> and the definition of <math id="A4.SS2.p2.m7" class="ltx_math_unparsed" alttext="\prob({\color[rgb]{0,0,0}\theta}\nonscript\&gt;|\nonscript\&gt;\mathopen{}{\color[rgb]{0,0,0}X})" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">ℙ</mi><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">θ</mi><mo fence="false" lspace="0.220em" rspace="0.387em" stretchy="false">|</mo><mrow><mphantom></mphantom><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">X</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\prob({\color[rgb]{0,0,0}\theta}\nonscript\&gt;|\nonscript\&gt;\mathopen{}{\color[rgb]{0,0,0}X})</annotation></semantics></math>, we have, almost surely,</span></p>
<table id="A4.EGx9" class="ltx_equationgroup ltx_eqn_align ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody id="A4.E21"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_right ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A4.E21.m1" class="ltx_math_unparsed" alttext="\displaystyle\ex_{#1}\left[\log\frac{d\prob({\color[rgb]{0,0,0}X}\nonscript\&gt;|\nonscript\&gt;\mathopen{}{\color[rgb]{0,0,0}{\color[rgb]{0,0,0}\theta}_{0}})}{d\prob({\color[rgb]{0,0,0}X}\nonscript\&gt;|\nonscript\&gt;\mathopen{}{\color[rgb]{0,0,0}\theta})}\right]+{\mathrm{KL}}\!(\prob_{\!#1}(\cdot\nonscript\&gt;|\nonscript\&gt;\mathopen{}{\color[rgb]{0,0,0}X})\,\|\,{\color[rgb]{0,0,0}\pi})" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">𝔼</mi><mrow><mi>#</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mrow><mo>[</mo><mi>log</mi><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">ℙ</mi><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">X</mi><mo fence="false" lspace="0.220em" rspace="0.387em" stretchy="false">|</mo><mphantom></mphantom><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">θ</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mn style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">0</mn></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">ℙ</mi><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">X</mi><mo fence="false" lspace="0.220em" rspace="0.387em" stretchy="false">|</mo><mphantom></mphantom><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">θ</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mfrac></mstyle><mo>]</mo></mrow><mo>+</mo><mpadded style="width:1.431em;" width="1.431em"><mi>KL</mi></mpadded><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">ℙ</mi><mrow><mi>#</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0.220em">⋅</mo><mo fence="false" rspace="0.387em" stretchy="false">|</mo><mrow><mphantom></mphantom><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">X</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo lspace="0.170em" rspace="0.337em">∥</mo><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">π</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle\ex_{#1}\left[\log\frac{d\prob({\color[rgb]{0,0,0}X}\nonscript\&gt;|\nonscript\&gt;\mathopen{}{\color[rgb]{0,0,0}{\color[rgb]{0,0,0}\theta}_{0}})}{d\prob({\color[rgb]{0,0,0}X}\nonscript\&gt;|\nonscript\&gt;\mathopen{}{\color[rgb]{0,0,0}\theta})}\right]+{\mathrm{KL}}\!(\prob_{\!#1}(\cdot\nonscript\&gt;|\nonscript\&gt;\mathopen{}{\color[rgb]{0,0,0}X})\,\|\,{\color[rgb]{0,0,0}\pi})</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A4.E21.m2" class="ltx_math_unparsed" alttext="\displaystyle=\inf_{\probalt}\left\{\ex_{#1}\left[\log\frac{d\prob({\color[rgb]{0,0,0}X}\nonscript\&gt;|\nonscript\&gt;\mathopen{}{\color[rgb]{0,0,0}{\color[rgb]{0,0,0}\theta}_{0}})}{d\prob({\color[rgb]{0,0,0}X}\nonscript\&gt;|\nonscript\&gt;\mathopen{}{\color[rgb]{0,0,0}\theta})}\right]{\mathrm{KL}}\!(\probalt\,\|\,{\color[rgb]{0,0,0}\pi})\right\}\,." display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mo rspace="0.1389em">=</mo><munder><mo lspace="0.1389em" movablelimits="false" rspace="0em">inf</mo><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">ℚ</mi></munder><mrow><mo>{</mo><msub><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">𝔼</mi><mrow><mi>#</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mrow><mo>[</mo><mi>log</mi><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">ℙ</mi><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">X</mi><mo fence="false" lspace="0.220em" rspace="0.387em" stretchy="false">|</mo><mphantom></mphantom><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">θ</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mn style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">0</mn></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">ℙ</mi><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">X</mi><mo fence="false" lspace="0.220em" rspace="0.387em" stretchy="false">|</mo><mphantom></mphantom><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">θ</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mfrac></mstyle><mo>]</mo></mrow><mpadded style="width:1.431em;" width="1.431em"><mi>KL</mi></mpadded><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">ℚ</mi><mo lspace="0.170em" rspace="0.337em">∥</mo><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">π</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo>}</mo></mrow><mo lspace="0.170em">.</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle=\inf_{\probalt}\left\{\ex_{#1}\left[\log\frac{d\prob({\color[rgb]{0,0,0}X}\nonscript\&gt;|\nonscript\&gt;\mathopen{}{\color[rgb]{0,0,0}{\color[rgb]{0,0,0}\theta}_{0}})}{d\prob({\color[rgb]{0,0,0}X}\nonscript\&gt;|\nonscript\&gt;\mathopen{}{\color[rgb]{0,0,0}\theta})}\right]{\mathrm{KL}}\!(\probalt\,\|\,{\color[rgb]{0,0,0}\pi})\right\}\,.</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td>
<td rowspan="1" class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_eqno ltx_align_middle ltx_align_right"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_equation ltx_align_right">(D.21)</span></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
<p id="A4.SS2.p2.5" class="ltx_p"><span id="A4.SS2.p2.5.1" class="ltx_text">Passing to the expectation over <math id="A4.SS2.p2.m8" class="ltx_Math" alttext="{\color[rgb]{0,0,0}X}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">X</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">{\color[rgb]{0,0,0}X}</annotation></semantics></math> we obtain that,</span></p>
<table id="A4.EGx10" class="ltx_equationgroup ltx_eqn_align ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody id="A4.E22"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_eqn_cell"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A4.E22.m1" class="ltx_math_unparsed" alttext="\displaystyle\ex\left[\log\frac{d\prob({\color[rgb]{0,0,0}X})}{d\prob({\color[rgb]{0,0,0}X}\nonscript\&gt;|\nonscript\&gt;\mathopen{}{\color[rgb]{0,0,0}\theta})}\right]+\ex_{#1}\left[{\mathrm{KL}}\!(\prob_{\!#1}(\cdot\nonscript\&gt;|\nonscript\&gt;\mathopen{}{\color[rgb]{0,0,0}X})\,\|\,{\color[rgb]{0,0,0}\pi})\right]" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">𝔼</mi><mrow><mo>[</mo><mi>log</mi><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><mrow><mi>d</mi><mo lspace="0.167em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">ℙ</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">X</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">ℙ</mi><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">X</mi><mo fence="false" lspace="0.220em" rspace="0.387em" stretchy="false">|</mo><mphantom></mphantom><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">θ</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mfrac></mstyle><mo>]</mo></mrow><mo>+</mo><msub><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">𝔼</mi><mrow><mi>#</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mrow><mo>[</mo><mpadded style="width:1.431em;" width="1.431em"><mi>KL</mi></mpadded><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">ℙ</mi><mrow><mi>#</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0.220em">⋅</mo><mo fence="false" rspace="0.387em" stretchy="false">|</mo><mrow><mphantom></mphantom><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">X</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo lspace="0.170em" rspace="0.337em">∥</mo><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">π</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo>]</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle\ex\left[\log\frac{d\prob({\color[rgb]{0,0,0}X})}{d\prob({\color[rgb]{0,0,0}X}\nonscript\&gt;|\nonscript\&gt;\mathopen{}{\color[rgb]{0,0,0}\theta})}\right]+\ex_{#1}\left[{\mathrm{KL}}\!(\prob_{\!#1}(\cdot\nonscript\&gt;|\nonscript\&gt;\mathopen{}{\color[rgb]{0,0,0}X})\,\|\,{\color[rgb]{0,0,0}\pi})\right]</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td>
<td rowspan="1" class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_eqno ltx_align_middle ltx_align_right"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_equation ltx_align_right">(D.22)</span></td></tr></tbody>
<tbody id="A4.E23"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_eqn_cell"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A4.E23.m1" class="ltx_math_unparsed" alttext="\displaystyle=\ex_{#1}\left[\inf_{\probalt}\left\{\ex_{#1}\left[\log\frac{d\prob({\color[rgb]{0,0,0}X}\nonscript\&gt;|\nonscript\&gt;\mathopen{}{\color[rgb]{0,0,0}{\color[rgb]{0,0,0}\theta}_{0}})}{d\prob({\color[rgb]{0,0,0}X}\nonscript\&gt;|\nonscript\&gt;\mathopen{}{\color[rgb]{0,0,0}\theta})}\right]+{\mathrm{KL}}\!(\probalt\,\|\,{\color[rgb]{0,0,0}\pi})\right\}\right]" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mo>=</mo><msub><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">𝔼</mi><mrow><mi>#</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mrow><mo>[</mo><munder><mo lspace="0em" movablelimits="false" rspace="0em">inf</mo><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">ℚ</mi></munder><mrow><mo>{</mo><msub><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">𝔼</mi><mrow><mi>#</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mrow><mo>[</mo><mi>log</mi><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">ℙ</mi><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">X</mi><mo fence="false" lspace="0.220em" rspace="0.387em" stretchy="false">|</mo><mphantom></mphantom><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">θ</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mn style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">0</mn></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">ℙ</mi><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">X</mi><mo fence="false" lspace="0.220em" rspace="0.387em" stretchy="false">|</mo><mphantom></mphantom><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">θ</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mfrac></mstyle><mo>]</mo></mrow><mo>+</mo><mpadded style="width:1.431em;" width="1.431em"><mi>KL</mi></mpadded><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">ℚ</mi><mo lspace="0.170em" rspace="0.337em">∥</mo><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">π</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo>}</mo></mrow><mo>]</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle=\ex_{#1}\left[\inf_{\probalt}\left\{\ex_{#1}\left[\log\frac{d\prob({\color[rgb]{0,0,0}X}\nonscript\&gt;|\nonscript\&gt;\mathopen{}{\color[rgb]{0,0,0}{\color[rgb]{0,0,0}\theta}_{0}})}{d\prob({\color[rgb]{0,0,0}X}\nonscript\&gt;|\nonscript\&gt;\mathopen{}{\color[rgb]{0,0,0}\theta})}\right]+{\mathrm{KL}}\!(\probalt\,\|\,{\color[rgb]{0,0,0}\pi})\right\}\right]</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td>
<td rowspan="1" class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_eqno ltx_align_middle ltx_align_right"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_equation ltx_align_right">(D.23)</span></td></tr></tbody>
<tbody id="A4.E24"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_eqn_cell"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A4.E24.m1" class="ltx_math_unparsed" alttext="\displaystyle\leq\inf_{\probalt}\left\{{\ex_{#1}\left[\ex_{#1}\left[\log\frac{d\prob({\color[rgb]{0,0,0}X}\nonscript\&gt;|\nonscript\&gt;\mathopen{}{\color[rgb]{0,0,0}{\color[rgb]{0,0,0}\theta}_{0}})}{d\prob({\color[rgb]{0,0,0}X}\nonscript\&gt;|\nonscript\&gt;\mathopen{}{\color[rgb]{0,0,0}\theta})}\right]\right]+{\mathrm{KL}}\!(\probalt\,\|\,{\color[rgb]{0,0,0}\pi})}\right\}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mo rspace="0.1389em">≤</mo><munder><mo lspace="0.1389em" movablelimits="false" rspace="0em">inf</mo><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">ℚ</mi></munder><mrow><mo>{</mo><msub><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">𝔼</mi><mrow><mi>#</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mrow><mo>[</mo><msub><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">𝔼</mi><mrow><mi>#</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mrow><mo>[</mo><mi>log</mi><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">ℙ</mi><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">X</mi><mo fence="false" lspace="0.220em" rspace="0.387em" stretchy="false">|</mo><mphantom></mphantom><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">θ</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mn style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">0</mn></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">ℙ</mi><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">X</mi><mo fence="false" lspace="0.220em" rspace="0.387em" stretchy="false">|</mo><mphantom></mphantom><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">θ</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mfrac></mstyle><mo>]</mo></mrow><mo>]</mo></mrow><mo>+</mo><mpadded style="width:1.431em;" width="1.431em"><mi>KL</mi></mpadded><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">ℚ</mi><mo lspace="0.170em" rspace="0.337em">∥</mo><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">π</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo>}</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle\leq\inf_{\probalt}\left\{{\ex_{#1}\left[\ex_{#1}\left[\log\frac{d\prob({\color[rgb]{0,0,0}X}\nonscript\&gt;|\nonscript\&gt;\mathopen{}{\color[rgb]{0,0,0}{\color[rgb]{0,0,0}\theta}_{0}})}{d\prob({\color[rgb]{0,0,0}X}\nonscript\&gt;|\nonscript\&gt;\mathopen{}{\color[rgb]{0,0,0}\theta})}\right]\right]+{\mathrm{KL}}\!(\probalt\,\|\,{\color[rgb]{0,0,0}\pi})}\right\}</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td>
<td rowspan="1" class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_eqno ltx_align_middle ltx_align_right"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_equation ltx_align_right">(D.24)</span></td></tr></tbody>
<tbody id="A4.E25"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_eqn_cell"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A4.E25.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle=-\log\ex_{#1}\left[\exp\left(-\ex_{#1}\left[\log\frac{\prob_{\!#1}(\cdot\nonscript\&gt;|\nonscript\&gt;\mathopen{}{\color[rgb]{0,0,0}{\color[rgb]{0,0,0}\theta}_{0}})}{\prob_{\!#1}(\cdot\nonscript\&gt;|\nonscript\&gt;\mathopen{}{\color[rgb]{0,0,0}\theta})}\right]\right)\right]\,," display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mphantom></mphantom><mo>=</mo><mrow><mo rspace="0.167em">−</mo><mrow><mrow><mi>log</mi><mo lspace="0.167em">⁡</mo><msub><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">𝔼</mi><mrow><mi>#</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo>[</mo><mrow><mi>exp</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo>(</mo><mrow><mo rspace="0.167em">−</mo><mrow><msub><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">𝔼</mi><mrow><mi>#</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo>[</mo><mrow><mi>log</mi><mo lspace="0.167em">⁡</mo><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><mrow><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">ℙ</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mrow><mi>#</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0.220em">⋅</mo><mo fence="false" rspace="0.387em" stretchy="false">|</mo><mphantom></mphantom><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">θ</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mn style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">0</mn></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mrow><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">ℙ</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mrow><mi>#</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0.220em">⋅</mo><mo fence="false" rspace="0.387em" stretchy="false">|</mo><mphantom></mphantom><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">θ</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mfrac></mstyle></mrow><mo>]</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo>)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo rspace="0.170em">]</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo>,</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle=-\log\ex_{#1}\left[\exp\left(-\ex_{#1}\left[\log\frac{\prob_{\!#1}(\cdot\nonscript\&gt;|\nonscript\&gt;\mathopen{}{\color[rgb]{0,0,0}{\color[rgb]{0,0,0}\theta}_{0}})}{\prob_{\!#1}(\cdot\nonscript\&gt;|\nonscript\&gt;\mathopen{}{\color[rgb]{0,0,0}\theta})}\right]\right)\right]\,,</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td>
<td rowspan="1" class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_eqno ltx_align_middle ltx_align_right"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_equation ltx_align_right">(D.25)</span></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
<p id="A4.SS2.p2.6" class="ltx_p"><span id="A4.SS2.p2.6.1" class="ltx_text">where the last line follows from <a href="#A4.Thmlemma1" title="Lemma D.1 (Donsker-Varadhan lemma, Gibbs variational principle). ‣ D.1 Preliminary Lemmas ‣ Appendix D Task Selection ‣ How Does the Pretraining Distribution Shape In-Context Learning?Task Selection, Generalization, and Robustness" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">Lemma</span> <span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">D.1</span></a> again with <math id="A4.SS2.p2.m9" class="ltx_Math" alttext="{\color[rgb]{0,0,0}g}({\color[rgb]{0,0,0}\theta})=-\ex_{#1}\left[\log\frac{d\prob_{\!#1}(\cdot\nonscript\&gt;|\nonscript\&gt;\mathopen{}{\color[rgb]{0,0,0}{\color[rgb]{0,0,0}\theta}_{0}})}{d\prob_{\!#1}(\cdot\nonscript\&gt;|\nonscript\&gt;\mathopen{}{\color[rgb]{0,0,0}\theta})}\right]" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">g</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">θ</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>=</mo><mrow><mo rspace="0.167em">−</mo><mrow><msub><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">𝔼</mi><mrow><mi>#</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo>[</mo><mrow><mi>log</mi><mo lspace="0.167em">⁡</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">ℙ</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mrow><mi>#</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0.220em">⋅</mo><mo fence="false" rspace="0.387em" stretchy="false">|</mo><mphantom></mphantom><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">θ</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mn style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">0</mn></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">ℙ</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mrow><mi>#</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0.220em">⋅</mo><mo fence="false" rspace="0.387em" stretchy="false">|</mo><mphantom></mphantom><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">θ</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mfrac></mrow><mo>]</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">{\color[rgb]{0,0,0}g}({\color[rgb]{0,0,0}\theta})=-\ex_{#1}\left[\log\frac{d\prob_{\!#1}(\cdot\nonscript\&gt;|\nonscript\&gt;\mathopen{}{\color[rgb]{0,0,0}{\color[rgb]{0,0,0}\theta}_{0}})}{d\prob_{\!#1}(\cdot\nonscript\&gt;|\nonscript\&gt;\mathopen{}{\color[rgb]{0,0,0}\theta})}\right]</annotation></semantics></math>. Let us now bound the second term in <a href="#A4.E20" title="In Proof. ‣ D.2 Template Task Selection Bound ‣ Appendix D Task Selection ‣ How Does the Pretraining Distribution Shape In-Context Learning?Task Selection, Generalization, and Robustness" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">Eq.</span> <span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">D.20</span></a>. We have, by <a href="#A4.Thmlemma1" title="Lemma D.1 (Donsker-Varadhan lemma, Gibbs variational principle). ‣ D.1 Preliminary Lemmas ‣ Appendix D Task Selection ‣ How Does the Pretraining Distribution Shape In-Context Learning?Task Selection, Generalization, and Robustness" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">Lemma</span> <span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">D.1</span></a> again,</span></p>
<table id="A4.EGx11" class="ltx_equationgroup ltx_eqn_align ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody id="A4.E26"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_eqn_cell"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A4.E26.m1" class="ltx_math_unparsed" alttext="\displaystyle\ex_{#1}\left[\log\frac{d\prob_{\!#1}(\cdot\nonscript\&gt;|\nonscript\&gt;\mathopen{}{\color[rgb]{0,0,0}{\color[rgb]{0,0,0}\theta}_{0}})}{d\prob_{\!#1}(\cdot\nonscript\&gt;|\nonscript\&gt;\mathopen{}{\color[rgb]{0,0,0}\theta})}\right]+{\color[rgb]{0,0,0}\mu}\ex_{#1}\left[{\mathrm{KL}}\!(\prob_{\!#1}(\cdot\nonscript\&gt;|\nonscript\&gt;\mathopen{}{\color[rgb]{0,0,0}X})\,\|\,{\color[rgb]{0,0,0}\pi})\right]" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">𝔼</mi><mrow><mi>#</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mrow><mo>[</mo><mi>log</mi><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">ℙ</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mrow><mi>#</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0.220em">⋅</mo><mo fence="false" rspace="0.387em" stretchy="false">|</mo><mphantom></mphantom><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">θ</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mn style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">0</mn></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">ℙ</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mrow><mi>#</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0.220em">⋅</mo><mo fence="false" rspace="0.387em" stretchy="false">|</mo><mphantom></mphantom><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">θ</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mfrac></mstyle><mo>]</mo></mrow><mo>+</mo><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">μ</mi><msub><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">𝔼</mi><mrow><mi>#</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mrow><mo>[</mo><mpadded style="width:1.431em;" width="1.431em"><mi>KL</mi></mpadded><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">ℙ</mi><mrow><mi>#</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0.220em">⋅</mo><mo fence="false" rspace="0.387em" stretchy="false">|</mo><mrow><mphantom></mphantom><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">X</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo lspace="0.170em" rspace="0.337em">∥</mo><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">π</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo>]</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle\ex_{#1}\left[\log\frac{d\prob_{\!#1}(\cdot\nonscript\&gt;|\nonscript\&gt;\mathopen{}{\color[rgb]{0,0,0}{\color[rgb]{0,0,0}\theta}_{0}})}{d\prob_{\!#1}(\cdot\nonscript\&gt;|\nonscript\&gt;\mathopen{}{\color[rgb]{0,0,0}\theta})}\right]+{\color[rgb]{0,0,0}\mu}\ex_{#1}\left[{\mathrm{KL}}\!(\prob_{\!#1}(\cdot\nonscript\&gt;|\nonscript\&gt;\mathopen{}{\color[rgb]{0,0,0}X})\,\|\,{\color[rgb]{0,0,0}\pi})\right]</annotation></semantics></math></td>
