<div id="A5.SS3.3" class="ltx_proof">
<h6 class="ltx_title ltx_runin ltx_font_italic ltx_title_proof">Proof.</h6>
<div id="A5.SS3.p21" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A5.SS3.p21.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A5.SS3.p21.1.1" class="ltx_text">We apply <a href="#A5.Thmlemma5" title="Lemma E.5. ‣ E.2 Technical lemmas ‣ Appendix E Generalization bounds ‣ How Does the Pretraining Distribution Shape In-Context Learning?Task Selection, Generalization, and Robustness" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">Lemma</span> <span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">E.5</span></a> to the moment bound from <a href="#A5.Thmlemma8" title="Lemma E.8. ‣ E.3 Concentration bounds for () ‣ Appendix E Generalization bounds ‣ How Does the Pretraining Distribution Shape In-Context Learning?Task Selection, Generalization, and Robustness" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">Lemma</span> <span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">E.8</span></a>.</span></p>
</div>
<div id="A5.SS3.p22" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A5.SS3.p22.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A5.SS3.p22.1.1" class="ltx_text">For <a href="#A5.Thmlemma5" title="Lemma E.5. ‣ E.2 Technical lemmas ‣ Appendix E Generalization bounds ‣ How Does the Pretraining Distribution Shape In-Context Learning?Task Selection, Generalization, and Robustness" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">Lemma</span> <span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">E.5</span></a>, we use:</span></p>
<table id="A5.EGx70" class="ltx_equationgroup ltx_eqn_align ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody id="A5.E135"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_right ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A5.E135.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle f({\color[rgb]{0,0,0}r})" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>f</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">r</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle f({\color[rgb]{0,0,0}r})</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A5.E135.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle={\color[rgb]{0,0,0}c}{\color[rgb]{0,0,0}\sigma}{\color[rgb]{0,0,0}L}_{{\color[rgb]{0,0,0}T}}\sqrt{\frac{{\color[rgb]{0,0,0}T}{\color[rgb]{0,0,0}r}}{{\color[rgb]{0,0,0}T}}}+{\color[rgb]{0,0,0}c}\sqrt{{\color[rgb]{0,0,0}r}}\frac{{\color[rgb]{0,0,0}L}_{{\color[rgb]{0,0,0}T}}}{\sqrt{{\color[rgb]{0,0,0}N}}}\sqrt{\sum_{{\color[rgb]{0,0,0}{\color[rgb]{0,0,0}t}}=1}^{\color[rgb]{0,0,0}T}\left(\sum_{{\color[rgb]{0,0,0}{\color[rgb]{0,0,0}s}}&gt;{\color[rgb]{0,0,0}{\color[rgb]{0,0,0}t}}}{\color[rgb]{0,0,0}B}_{{\color[rgb]{0,0,0}{\color[rgb]{0,0,0}t}},{\color[rgb]{0,0,0}{\color[rgb]{0,0,0}s}}}\right)^{2}}\left\lVert{\color[rgb]{0,0,0}\theta}_{1}\right\rVert_{2}+{\color[rgb]{0,0,0}c}\sqrt{{\color[rgb]{0,0,0}r}}\frac{{\color[rgb]{0,0,0}L}_{{\color[rgb]{0,0,0}T}}}{\sqrt{{\color[rgb]{0,0,0}N}}}\left(\sum_{{\color[rgb]{0,0,0}{\color[rgb]{0,0,0}t}}=1}^{\color[rgb]{0,0,0}T}{\color[rgb]{0,0,0}A}_{\color[rgb]{0,0,0}{\color[rgb]{0,0,0}t}}\right)\left\lVert{\color[rgb]{0,0,0}\theta}_{1}-\ex[{\color[rgb]{0,0,0}\theta}_{1}]\right\rVert_{2}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mphantom></mphantom><mo>=</mo><mrow><mrow><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">c</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">σ</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">L</mi><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">T</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msqrt><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><mrow><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">T</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">r</mi></mrow><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">T</mi></mfrac></mstyle></msqrt></mrow><mo>+</mo><mrow><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">c</mi><mo lspac