<p id="A5.SS4.p2.4" class="ltx_p"><span id="A5.SS4.p2.4.1" class="ltx_text">Applying <a href="#A5.Thmlemma7" title="Lemma E.7 (Dudley–type entropy integral under 𝐿^𝑝 increments). ‣ E.2 Technical lemmas ‣ Appendix E Generalization bounds ‣ How Does the Pretraining Distribution Shape In-Context Learning?Task Selection, Generalization, and Robustness" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">Lemma</span> <span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">E.7</span></a> then gives that</span></p>
