<p id="A5.SS4.p2.5" class="ltx_p"><span id="A5.SS4.p2.5.1" class="ltx_text">is bounded by the <abbr title="" class="ltx_glossaryref ltx_missing">RHS</abbr> of the statement of the lemma.
To conclude, it suffices to notice that, for any <math id="A5.SS4.p2.m5" class="ltx_Math" alttext="{\color[rgb]{0,0,0}f}_{0}\in{\color[rgb]{0,0,0}\mathcal{F}}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">f</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mo>∈</mo><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic" mathcolor="#000000">ℱ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">{\color[rgb]{0,0,0}f}_{0}\in{\color[rgb]{0,0,0}\mathcal{F}}</annotation></semantics></math> fixed,</span></p>
<table id="A5.EGx75" class="ltx_equationgroup ltx_eqn_align ltx_eqn_table">

